<p>Whenever you use a non-instant talent you launch a spear of bone at all enemies afflicted by 3 or more magical detrimental effects dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">34, 46, 55, 63, 70</acronym> physical damage to all enemies it passes through.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>